  "statement": "Let \\(f(r)=\\sum_{j=2}^{2008} \\frac{1}{j^{r}}=\\frac{1}{2^{r}}+\\frac{1}{3^{r}}+\\cdots+\\frac{1}{2008^{r}}\\). Find \\(\\sum_{k=2}^{\\infty} f(k)\\).",
