      "id": "sol.hmmt-feb-guts-2008-p11.hmmt",
      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "\\(\\frac{2007}{2008}\\) We change the order of summation:\n\\[\\sum_{k=2}^{\\infty} \\sum_{j=2}^{2008} \\frac{1}{j^{k}}=\\sum_{j=2}^{2008} \\sum_{k=2}^{\\infty} \\frac{1}{j^{k}}=\\sum_{j=2}^{2008} \\frac{1}{j^{2}\\left(1-\\frac{1}{j}\\right)}=\\sum_{j=2}^{2008} \\frac{1}{j(j-1)}=\\sum_{j=2}^{2008}\\left(\\frac{1}{j-1}-\\frac{1}{j}\\right)=1-\\frac{1}{2008}=\\frac{2007}{2008}\\]",
